The tasklet drops the channel's runtime PM reference whenever the work list is empty, even when
pl330_terminate_all() has emptied it and dropped that reference already: « Runtime PM usage count
underflow! ». The controller is shared (eMMC, SDIO): its count can reach zero under the other
channel's transfer. `active` says that a reference is held.

--- a/drivers/dma/pl330.c
+++ b/drivers/dma/pl330.c
@@ -2090,7 +2090,7 @@
 		spin_lock(&pch->thread->dmac->lock);
 		_stop(pch->thread);
 		spin_unlock(&pch->thread->dmac->lock);
-		power_down = true;
+		power_down = pch->active;
 		pch->active = false;
 	} else {
 		/* Make sure the PL330 Channel thread is active */
